  "books": {
    "opening": [
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.opening.1.1.wav",
        "seconds": 3.36,
        "caption": "Bellwether. A fishing town on the Pacific coast.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "850eeb865472c02f"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.opening.1.2.wav",
        "seconds": 4.72,
        "caption": "Six thousand people, one radio station, and a lot of fog.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "b7af617247da6173"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.opening.2.1.wav",
        "seconds": 6.8,
        "caption": "I’m Steve Mercer. For twelve years I ran the night shift at KBWR, the town radio station.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "3b4333776d6e6e70"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.opening.2.2.wav",
        "seconds": 5.52,
        "caption": "Nobody hears the night engineer. The night engineer hears everything.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "9b9d04d392b5dae3"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.opening.3.1.wav",
        "seconds": 7.6,
        "caption": "My dad, Frank, taught me how to listen. Every sound has a source, he used to say. Go and find it.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "7eb0a6c18776584c"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.opening.3.2.wav",
        "seconds": 6.32,
        "caption": "Ham radio, every night. Strangers from all over the world, all of them his friends.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "67f21e632a8a523c"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.opening.4.1.wav",
        "seconds": 7.36,
        "caption": "My mom, Helen, was an interpreter. Government work, rooms with no windows. She never talked about it.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "af6b35afd2607245"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.opening.4.2.wav",
        "seconds": 4.24,
        "caption": "She could hear what people meant, even when they said something else.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "9437e9c87bc40810"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.opening.5.1.wav",
        "seconds": 6.8,
        "caption": "Eighteen months ago, they rowed out into the bay after dark. They said the water was making a sound.",
        "status": "manual_review_passed",
        "text_hash": "0ad4b12aa2eb1d1d"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.opening.5.2.wav",
        "seconds": 1.92,
        "caption": "They asked me to come along.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "1b9c2b12504fb6de"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.opening.5.3.wav",
        "seconds": 2.32,
        "caption": "I said no. I had a shift.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "9fba7fe97cf1d9bc"
      }
    ],
    "aftermath": [
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.aftermath.1.1.wav",
        "seconds": 4.16,
        "caption": "In the morning, their boat drifted back to shore. Empty.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "79d0e6f299b7d11c"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.aftermath.1.2.wav",
        "seconds": 2.32,
        "caption": "Dad’s radio was still on.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "91576310f42b3899"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.aftermath.2.1.wav",
        "seconds": 3.6,
        "caption": "Nobody found them. That was eighteen months ago.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "691fddf3bbd8b984"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-additions/book.aftermath.2.2.wav",
        "seconds": 10.08,
        "caption": "Mom called me from the boat that night. I dubbed her phone voicemail onto a cassette. Most nights I play it at three in the morning. I don’t know what I’m listening for.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "b5a2584aa019b8e1"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.aftermath.3.1.wav",
        "seconds": 4.72,
        "caption": "A year ago a company called Halcyon Media bought KBWR.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "ebde4cf81d57da4f"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.aftermath.3.2.wav",
        "seconds": 6.56,
        "caption": "Three weeks ago they replaced me with a machine called DJ AutoRick. It reads yesterday’s weather.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "45d35c3d92488a13"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.aftermath.4.1.wav",
        "seconds": 7.44,
        "caption": "And then there’s Nora. Nora Reyes runs the animals at the aquarium and argues with everybody, me included.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "b82fa2aeb435e228"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.aftermath.4.2.wav",
        "seconds": 10.4,
        "caption": "After the boat I went quiet. She pushed, then shouted, then stopped. Lately she’s been endlessly patient with me. I figured I’d worn her out.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "bb69fc45319b40d6"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.aftermath.5.1.wav",
        "seconds": 5.84,
        "caption": "So now I’m home in the mornings, with Dad’s old tape recorder and nothing left to fix.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "3bfb6d437edde880"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.aftermath.5.2.wav",
        "seconds": 3.44,
        "caption": "This is the story of how I started counting nights.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "8774c62bbfb4b096"
      }
    ],
    "after": [
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.after.1.1.wav",
        "seconds": 6.56,
        "caption": "Before the ship left, the Choir gave the copies one last gift. They don’t need the ninth night anymore.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "00970f1023d62b85"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.after.1.2.wav",
        "seconds": 6.72,
        "caption": "More than two hundred of them stayed. Bellwether has a lot of new neighbors with familiar faces.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "0905c35c40148180"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.after.2.1.wav",
        "seconds": 7.44,
        "caption": "Iris chose a face of her own. People still say hello to the wrong Steve sometimes. We both say hello back.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "57ef81efbc3ba18c"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.after.3.1.wav",
        "seconds": 4.32,
        "caption": "Mom and Dad came home. Dad is back on the radio every Thursday.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "dd3be557fd490dbf"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.after.3.2.wav",
        "seconds": 5.2,
        "caption": "Dad labels everything now. The paint, the radios, me.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "082697bbcf16a46b"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.after.4.1.wav",
        "seconds": 2.32,
        "caption": "I don’t play the old voicemail anymore.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "b9310592318c6925"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.after.4.2.wav",
        "seconds": 4.24,
        "caption": "The ring isn’t in the sock drawer anymore. Ask Nora where it is.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "d674ff570909fb5c"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-additions/book.after.4.3.wav",
        "seconds": 5.92,
        "caption": "Nora argues with me again. About everything. I missed it more than I can say.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "cc296916084650c1"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.after.5.1.wav",
        "seconds": 3.84,
        "caption": "KBWR has live hosts again. Two of them.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "9e873156188c1656"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.after.5.2.wav",
        "seconds": 4.16,
        "caption": "Stephen and I still argue about which one of us is the upgrade.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
        "text_hash": "f45582d027c54e66"
      },
      {
        "file": "res://assets/audio/voices/elevenlabs-v4-script-v2/book.after.6.1.wav",
        "seconds": 4.32,
        "caption": "One year after the ninth night, a package arrived at the station.",
        "status": "automated_qa_passed",
